---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = '2026-10-24';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Subprocessors"
  description="PromptDNS subprocessors: Cloudflare for hosting and delivery, public DoH resolvers queried client-side, and Dodo Payments for payments when paid plans launch."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Subprocessors</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Subprocessors and services</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-faint">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-dim">
      PromptDNS collects no personal data from tool usage. These are the third parties involved
      in running the site, stated plainly.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-line">
      <table class="pdns-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Role</th><th>Status</th><th>What they process</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink">Cloudflare</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Hosting, CDN, TLS, DNS for promptdns.com</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Active</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Standard web server logs (IP, path, timestamp) at the edge</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink">Public DoH resolvers (Cloudflare, Google, AliDNS)</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Answer the DNS queries your browser makes when you use our tools</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Active</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Your queries, under each resolver's own public privacy policy - PromptDNS is not in this path</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink">Public CORS relays (used only when a site blocks direct browser fetches)</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Fetch robots.txt / headers on behalf of a tool</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Active</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">The URL a tool needs to read; no PromptDNS user data</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink">Dodo Payments</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Merchant of record for paid plans</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Planned - added at billing launch</td>
            <td class="text-sm text-ink-dim">Payment details, billing name/email, invoices</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="rich-text mt-8">
      <h2>What we would store at monitoring launch</h2>
      <p>
        Monitoring accounts (in development) will store the domains you add, their DNS check
        results, alert history, and your account email. No payment card data: that stays with
        Dodo Payments. This page will be updated before any account system goes live.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Data-processing questions: <a href="mailto:support@promptdns.com" class="text-accent">support@promptdns.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
